# ---- Christmas in the Almanac ----
almanac.christmas.title = Christmas
almanac.christmas.flavor = Every winter Santa sets up by his tree in the Forgotten Temple, and the village comes to help him.
almanac.christmas.thieves_caught = Present Thieves caught
almanac.christmas.presents_opened = Presents opened
almanac.christmas.presents_given = Presents given to friends
almanac.christmas.carols_sung = Carols sung
almanac.christmas.snowballs_thrown = Snowballs thrown
almanac.christmas.yetis_defeated = Yetis beaten
almanac.christmas.yeti.title = The Yeti
almanac.christmas.yeti.line = Something big has moved into a cave up in the snow. Bring Bram some Yeti Bait and he'll lead you and your friends into the Yeti Cave.
almanac.christmas.source.present = Present Thieves drop them, Elsie sells them, and Santa and his helpers hand them out.
almanac.christmas.source.snowball = Bram hands out a free bundle every day.
almanac.christmas.source.cookie = Baked at a Chef's Stove from Tomas's recipe.
almanac.christmas.source.cook_dish = Made at a Chef's Stove, once you've learned it from a recipe Tomas sells.
almanac.christmas.source.recipe_cookie = Bram passes it on from Tomas during Santa's story, and Tomas sells it.
almanac.christmas.source.bakery_favor = Sold at Tomas's bakery as you climb Santa's Nice List.
almanac.christmas.source.candy_cane = Sold at Santa's shop, and given for every carol you sing.
almanac.christmas.source.elsie_favor = Sold at Elsie's shop as you climb Santa's Nice List.
almanac.christmas.source.santa_suit = Sold at Elsie's shop, and waiting under Santa's tree on Christmas Morning.
almanac.christmas.source.elf_suit = Elsie gives you one for helping her wrap presents.
almanac.christmas.source.yeti_bait = Sold at Bram's shop once you've brought his reindeer their carrots. Bram takes one to lead you into the Yeti Cave.
almanac.christmas.source.yeti_fur = The Yeti sometimes leaves one behind the first time you beat him each day.
almanac.christmas.source.santa_stall = Sold at Santa's shop.
almanac.christmas.source.morning = Under Santa's tree on Christmas Morning, and now and then in a Santa's Sack.
almanac.christmas.source.bauble = Falls out of trees you chop while Christmas runs, and hides in presents.
almanac.christmas.source.winter = Sold on the festival shelf at Santa's shop while Christmas runs.
almanac.christmas.source.keepsake = Christmas Eve's keepsake, given once a year when you help Santa fill his sleigh.
almanac.christmas.source.festival_favor = Sold on the festival shelf at Santa's shop to those high in Festival Favor.
